# flatnotes requires no secrets of its own at install time.
# Access is controlled by the Traefik basic-auth gate declared in metadata.yaml
# (basic_auth: true) — the customer's server password is applied there, not here.
# Built-in authentication is disabled (FLATNOTES_AUTH_TYPE=none is set in
# docker-compose.yaml) because the platform's Traefik gate handles access control.
#
# The application's own hostname is supplied automatically as AF_APP_DOMAIN.
